{
  "slug": "tiga-gtm",
  "name": "Tiga Gtm",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build tools and scripts for using the Tiga sales intelligence platform",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `flow-builder` (Build Tiga 'flow' play_type sequences end-to-end via the Tiga API using curl), `list-building` (Build GTM lists — target accounts and the people at them — using the Tiga API), `sequence-builder` (Author and modify outbound sequence content with the Tiga API — steps and their AI personalizations), `sequence-runner` (Operate outbound sequences with the Tiga API — enroll and remove people, check sequence performance, and build lists…), `signals` (Create, run, and score AI signals with the Tiga API — at any scale), `tiga-gtm` (Execute GTM (Go-To-Market) workflows using the Tiga sales intelligence API (app.tigalabs.com))\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tiga-gtm@claude-community` from `tiga-labs/tiga-gtm`.",
